	note = {Cited by: 10; Conference name: 11th IEEE International Conference on Trust, Security and Privacy in Computing and Communications, TrustCom-2012; Conference sponsors: University of Bradford; IEEE Technical Committee on Scalable Computing (TCSC); IEEE; IEEE Computer Society; Conference location: null; Conference code: 93340; Conference date: 25 June 2012 through 27 June 2012}
